  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fred og konfliktl&#xf8;sning med eksempler fra Sydsudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will aim to reach a new audience in Denmark with messages and stories of reconciliation from the South Sudan. There will be three target groups: 1. Entusiastic young people (aged 18-30), 2. Busy families (aged 30-55) and 3. People above 55 years. Stories will be collected by a freelance journalist travelling to South Sudan. There will be articles in selected media and podcasts and videos will be produced and posted on external and internal media. We aim to an build an increased understanding of reconciliation work and to increase interest in development assistance by documenting that aid matters.</narrative>
  </description>
